"""Source-only A17.var06 evidence-index design. This draft cannot write an index.

Final method requires independent postrun pins, a reviewed finite context map,
and a root-authored publication-proof manifest before candidate execution.
No mode calls SIMLOX, a checker, or an independent behavior reader.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

